WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
How to review your drawings.
Demo guide with illustrative screens.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
1. Open Drawings in your portal
and pick the latest issued revision.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
2. Zoom in on the area
you want to talk about.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.600
3. Choose Add comment and click that spot
on the drawing, then type your comment and save it.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.000
Your comment stays with that revision.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.600
4. When the current revision is right,
choose Approve and confirm.

7
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.000
Approval applies to that revision only.
A later revision needs its own approval.
